# Legal profile — Legal-Assistant-v3
# https://github.com/The-HOLE-Foundation/Legal-Assistant-v3
#
# Activated by adding "legal" to `projects` in ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml.
# See docs/profiles/legal.md for what this installs and what is manual.
#
# Anything that already lives in dot_Brewfile.core is intentionally NOT
# duplicated here. As of 2026-06-02 core already provides:
#   pyenv, uv, doppler, go, git, gh, lazygit, jq, fd, ripgrep
# So this file only carries OS-level deps that are *specific* to the
# legal-assistant workflow.

# ── PDF / OCR pipeline ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required by `av-ocr-rebuild --optimize`: Ghostscript is the post-OCR
# linearization + size-reduction pass. See packages/av-ocr-rebuild/README.md
# in Legal-Assistant-v3.
brew "ghostscript"

